              "preset": "max_width_1440",
              "jcr:created": "Tue May 26 2026 20:23:16 GMT+0000",
              "alt": "Mobility matters: Positive impact of safe mobilization",
              "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sage/focusrn-live/videos/3179600_mobility-matters-title-screen.jpg",
              "borderColor": "rgb(0,0,0)",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue May 26 2026 20:24:05 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
              "linkInternal": "/content/stryker/us/en/sage/webinars/mobility-matters-impact-safe-patient-mobilization",
              "enableBorder": "true"
            },
            "text_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Thu Apr 03 2025 21:28:08 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<h4>Mobility Matters: Positive impact of safe mobilization</h4>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Jan Powers PhD, RN, CCNS, CCRN, NE-BC, EBP-C, FCNS, FCCM, FAAN</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This webinar will review the effects of immobility and emphasize the importance of early mobility for driving better patient outcomes. We will highlight the nurse's role in safe patient handling to help reduce caregiver injuries and outline best practices for mobilizing patients. We will cover effective strategies for implementing mobility programs to enhance consistency, safety and long-term success.</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/sage/webinars/mobility-matters-impact-safe-patient-mobilization.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Watch Now</span></a></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jun 03 2026 19:51:21 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
          "col2": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "standaloneimage_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "preset": "max_width_1440",
              "jcr:created": "Tue Apr 15 2025 15:47:44 GMT+0000",
              "alt": "FocusRN-pip-operative-procedure-thumbnail",
              "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sage/focusrn-live/videos/FocusRN-pip-operative-procedure-thumbnail.jpg",
              "borderColor": "rgb(0,0,0)",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Apr 15 2025 15:56:15 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
              "linkInternal": "/content/stryker/us/en/sage/webinars/risk-of-pip-procedural-operational-areas",
              "enableBorder": "true"
            },
            "text_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Thu Apr 03 2025 21:28:08 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<h4>Risk of Pressure Injury in Operative and Procedure Areas</h4>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Suzy Scott MSN, RN, FAAN</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Undergoing any operative procedure can place a patient at higher risk of pressure injury development. Depending on time, position and vital parameters, a patient's skin injury may not be apparent for several days post-op. During this webinar, you will learn to identify patients' risk factors as well as common surgical positions and instrumentation and devices used during this phase of care that increase risk. Interventions to reduce the risk to your patients in a structured perioperative pressure injury prevention program will be discussed.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/sage/webinars/risk-of-pip-procedural-operational-areas.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Watch now</span></a></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 13 2025 14:10:45 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
          "col3": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "standaloneimage": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "preset": "max_width_1440",
              "jcr:created": "Wed Oct 01 2025 19:47:42 GMT+0000",
              "alt": "Safe patient  handling and mobility - Reducing the risk through evidence-based interventions",
              "srcFileRef": "/content/dam/stryker/sage/focusrn-live/videos/safe-patient-handling-july-webinar-thumbnail.jpg",
              "borderColor": "rgb(0,0,0)",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 01 2025 19:51:08 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/standaloneimage",
              "linkInternal": "/content/stryker/us/en/sage/webinars/safe-patient-handling-mobility-webinar",
              "enableBorder": "true"
            },
            "text_copy_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Thu Apr 03 2025 21:28:08 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<h4>Safe patient handling and mobility - Reducing the risk through evidence-based interventions</h4>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Susan Salsbury BS, OTR/L, CSPHP, CDMS-R</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">A comprehensive overview of safe patient handling and mobility (SPHM) practices, emphasizing the dual goals of enhancing patient outcomes and ensuring caregiver safety. We will identify risk factors that contribute to patient handling injuries, explore resources to help implement and maintain a SPHM program, and understand the interconnectedness between early mobility, SPHM, fall prevention, pressure injury prevention and improved patient outcomes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/sage/webinars/safe-patient-handling-mobility-webinar.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Watch now</span></a></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 01 2025 19:50:50 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          }
        }
      },
